&lt;td style="width: 91.95pt; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1pt; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 1pt; border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1pt; padding-right: 4.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: right; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 91.95pt; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1pt; border-left-style: solid; border-left-width: 1pt; padding-right: 4.9pt; padding-left: 4.9pt; vertical-align: top;"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: right; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;6.7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Transactions billed from affiliates, included within Utility Plant on the Comparative Balance Sheet, were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and $6.4 million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;There were distributions paid to members of $ 103.9 million in 2025 and $ 117.9 million in 2024, included within Retained Earnings on the Comparative Balance Sheet. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;. Joint Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are party to a joint ownership agreement with Southern Natural Gas Company (SONAT) whereby a portion of the capacity of a specified section of the pipeline is owned by SONAT. Under the joint ownership agreement, SONAT reimburses us for certain construction costs and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;shares in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; operating costs associated with its share of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;capacity of the pipeline. The SONAT capacity entitlement is part of SONAT&amp;#8217;s system and is not part of our system. Accordingly, the costs and revenues associated with SONAT&amp;#8217;s capacity are not reflected in our results of operations, financial position or cash flows. Total billings invoiced for capital expenses were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million and $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, respectively. Total billings invoiced for operating expenses were $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5.9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million and $5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million in 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, respectively. Receivable due from SONAT, totaling $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;2.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; December 31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; and $1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; million &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; December 31, 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;, are classified as Other Accounts Receivable in the Comparative Balance Sheets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Reimbursements for construction costs paid by us on behalf of SONAT are presented as Other within Investing Activities in our Statement of Cash Flows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;9&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;. Utility Plant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
