          <tbody>
            <tr style="height: 15pt;">
              <td class="xl52687" style="height: 15pt; width: 444pt;" width="592" height="20">Fuel quantities requiring an allocation are assigned to the rate categories on the basis of the&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height: 15pt;">
              <td class="xl52687" style="height: 15pt;" height="20">stated fuel rates as referenced in Order No. 710-C, at paragraph 9.&#160; Specifically, within each&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height: 15pt;">
              <td class="xl52687" style="height: 15pt;" height="20">functional category, the fuel quantities in lines 8 &#8211; 30 are prorated to the rate categories based on&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height: 15pt;">
              <td class="xl52687" style="height: 15pt;" height="20">the ratio of the Shipper Supplied quantities in lines 1 - 7 for each rate category to the total&#160;</td>
